  "spiritual_reading": "# Spiritual Translation\n\n** ¶1:**\n\nWhen the Divine operative wisdom descended into the created order, it bore with it three degrees of accommodated truth: truth as rational understanding, truth as the expression of love, and truth as natural knowledge. These it assumed from the Divine origin and cloth ed itself within them . Through these three degrees of external truth it established order among all spiritual states, both interior and exterior, and arranged them so that the Divine could be manifested through successive cov erings. Afterward, having accomplished its works of ordering , it laid aside these external accommod ations in the presence of those dwelling in states of genuine good — revealing to them the naked interior realities that the truths had ve iled.\n\n**¶2:**\n\nWhen it was about to release these degrees , it loosened them from their point of conjunction and withdrew itself from within them . And so these three degrees of accommodated truth are disposed in order, extending from the outermost boundary of the limiting state between what is interior and what is exterior, encompassing all things within that boundary . From above, at the most interior point, the limiting boundary itself is removed; and what had served as the outermost covering is set beneath the interior re alities and then elevated back toward the heights from which it had originally proceeded — returning to the Divine origin from which it was first sent forth at the beginning of all ordering .\n\n---\n\n*Note : The \" zone \" — the cosmic belt or boundary — corresponds to the lim inal state separ ating discrete degrees . Its removal \" at its topmost point\" describes the opening of infl ux when the accommod ating form is no longer needed : truth returns to its source.*",
